1: भा. VI. १०. २१; VIII. १०. ५७.
a son of Praheti, the राक्षस;
2: Br.

(III)--a son of लङ्कु;
1: वा. ६९. १२८, १६५.
resident of the fourth talam or gabhastalam;
2: Ib. ५०. ३२.
milked both milk and blood in कपालपात्र by which the राक्षसस् prosper;
3: Ib. ६२. १८४.
acted as calf when the राक्षसस् milked the cow-earth.
4: M. १०. २३.
